  "story": "Set up Wed 2 Dec 2026 at 07:00 on a phone in Japan (+09:00): the bank holds 500,000, an e-wallet 10,000, a dollar wallet 100.00, a card owes 30,000 (its 15 Nov statement was 0 and paid) and a credit line owes 100,000. Pay of 250,000 is due that day (the 2nd). Records dated 2 Dec with no time of their own (a ticked pay, a refund, a top-up to the e-wallet, a card payment, a draw on the credit line, a change of yen into dollars, an accepted difference) start at the start of 2 Dec on this device, so each is inside the 07:00 opening. Before X9 a date with no time started at midnight UTC (09:00 in Japan), after the opening, and every one of them moved the figures again. Every amount is made up.",
